  "edits": [
    {
      "id": "A39477-zh-00001",
      "source_hash": "1cb2dccdd457048eba6bdb5f24b24eda7e9a04dea9a360d0445a7317dfb650d5",
      "text": "■ 《防止人口贩运等及保护受害者等法施行令》〔附表四〕〈2026年3月24日修订〉"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39477-zh-00003",
      "source_hash": "2a8a3726749eb11eaee4dcce7d03ee377f1ddef6dff29476902e0cd13da8e8bb",
      "text": "1. 入住者管理"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39477-zh-00004",
      "source_hash": "807fb83d625cacd92a56b78228f32726cd6368632a5904ccf95821e2cc01ee71",
      "text": "甲. 应考虑入住者的年龄、性格及身心健康状况，对其进行观察和指导，并根据"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39477-zh-00005",
      "source_hash": "cc0aa6f346e5ef810e744a3571d980fb09b9e0dcb3f307969ecd66933f402f01",
      "text": "保护工作的进展，采取安排回家或者转往其他支援设施等必要措施。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39477-zh-00007",
      "source_hash": "48174f7f6aa7241017ae4922d39b1082fa808b82834825826a1c98772e486fbc",
      "text": "乙. 应保持入住者生活环境清洁，并根据其健康状况安排运动和休息。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39477-zh-00009",
      "source_hash": "eb11e0fd38898c17619ad5edbe478059594b439dbc180e077b0e3f5cfc0f4b42",
      "text": "丙. 不得允许入住者（包括入住者的子女中经支援设施负责人认可的婴幼儿）"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39477-zh-00010",
      "source_hash": "5ce184ef39976ae932ca4011b3aea95e713722cd37c389667afc12d933d83071",
      "text": "及支援设施工作人员以外的人在支援设施居住。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39477-zh-00011",
      "source_hash": "7674b188ded8214222a4fe03752594c177e504d692989ce2327f6450921a750c",
      "text": "丁. 因受害者等入住、退所等导致入住人数变化时，应当向"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39477-zh-00012",
      "source_hash": "1fb5103739522e4d7f359f5ebf1988248e44e5475a45cb61574e02bbf9c526aa",
      "text": "指定权人（指指定该支援设施的市、道知事或者市长、郡守、区厅长）"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39477-zh-00013",
      "source_hash": "c43f4fff108e4258de3806af25b6d309409974f2b84196a9f542b389ef5a9f2e",
      "text": "报告。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39477-zh-00017",
      "source_hash": "6207cacb3e0f4fe60a884d1df270654e983061213aa022a75d3d649a4af1e5c6",
      "text": "丙. 支援设施入住办法"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39477-zh-00020",
      "source_hash": "81595a8c77d3fa1546bcc421e3b0683f622dd6e67ece882fa44d25501bd1b59d",
      "text": "3. 备置账簿等"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39477-zh-00021",
      "source_hash": "621352559e3fd2e3e6f198278dccfe4f640ee6a59d469d4e7254afea891b8b34",
      "text": "应当将下列各项的账簿及文件备置于办公室。在此情况下，下列各项所列账簿"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39477-zh-00022",
      "source_hash": "da98e766f9f885a9afbdd6d0568c36cf5b23a5866bfaf61a910d02d150911d3b",
      "text": "及文件可以按照《电子文书及电子交易基本法》第五条规定，以电子文书或者电子化"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39477-zh-00023",
      "source_hash": "3b55552fffd1e1be0f41b879ed24f1d999fbeb1cd7e9dc325e0f270ea308db09",
      "text": "文书形式保存。"
    }
  ],
  "note": "Korean source and 24 XML fragments compared. Corrects occupancy management, infant exception, reporting occupancy to designating authority, operation protocols, and electronic/electronized records preservation. Other nine rows unchanged."
}